<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian June unemployment steady at 14.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenian June unemployment steady at 14.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	June	 May	June 96</p>
<p>    Percentage			14.1	14.1	  13.3</p>
<p>    Total			  122,613   122,518     113,977 -- Ljubljana</p>
<p>newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
